    h1: "Responsive Apartment Water Damage Cleanup in Belleville, IL",
    intro: "A leak in a rental affects two parties at once, and often a neighbor as well. We handle apartment water damage in Belleville, IL for landlords, property managers and tenants in duplexes, two-flats, apartment buildings and single-family rentals: water removal, drying, cleaning and repairs. Call and a crew is dispatched immediately.",
